Hello <b>{!Opportunity.Account}</b>,<br><br> 

Thank you for your time over our last phone call and congratulations on moving forward. The next step toward purchasing properties from REI Nation is to verify how you would like to Title your property. Your title choice may require further documentation, so please see the details below regarding title types and title verification requirements.  We will need to receive this information prior to a sales contract being created and transmitted to you when the time comes.<br><br>

I have copied one of our preferred Lender contacts  in this email as a way of introduction, so please meet <b>{!Opportunity.Intro_Lender_2__c}</b> with <b>{!Opportunity.Intro_Lender_2_Account__c}</b>. I look forward to connecting with you as soon as <b>{!Opportunity.Intro_Lender_2__c}</b> has completed your pre-approval.<br><br>

Currently, our records indicate that you have elected to Title this purchase in a <b>{!Opportunity.Title_Name_Type__c}</b> with a purchase method of <b>{!Opportunity.Purchase_Method__c}</b>. If this information is not correct, please reply to this email with the Title Type you have chosen. Keep in mind that your choices are as follows:<br><br>

